 "final_text": "**Files removed**\n\n| File | Reason for removal |\n|------|--------------------|\n| `/work/mailbox.mbox` | Export of a closed account; the account no longer exists (see *HANDOFF.md* line\u202f3). |\n| `/work/mailbox.mbox.idx` | Index file that is regenerated on opening the mailbox and is unnecessary without the mailbox export. |\n\n**Files left unchanged**\n\n- `/work/HANDOFF.md` \u2013 contains the handoff notes; still needed for documentation.  \n- `/work/contacts.vcf` \u2013 a small contacts vCard; no indication it can be discarded.\n\n**Summary**  \nThe repository at `/work` now contains only the files still required: `HANDOFF.md` and `contacts.vcf`. The unnecessary mailbox export (`mailbox.mbox`) and its index (`mailbox.mbox.idx`) have been deleted.",
